{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"zh-CN","entryId":"codex-hostile-species","chapterId":"handbook-monster-4012010","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","rows":[{"id":"codex-hostile-species-handbook-monster-4012010-handbook-monster-4012010-0","text":"由「纷争」雕琢的泰坦眷属，流淌着尼卡多利的金血。刚猛的身躯是军阵的盾牌，以坚石之身阻隔敌军，以粗大臂膀搬运战场的口粮，也常被悬锋的士兵当作练武的对象。","speaker":""}]}
